WEBVTT

00:36:29.843 --> 00:36:32.676
and more on the motivation
and ability to learn,

00:36:32.700 --> 00:36:35.392
less on invisible,
unreliable gut feelings,

00:36:35.416 --> 00:36:37.091
and more on structured questions

00:36:37.115 --> 00:36:40.170
and challenges that actually pertain
to the work at hand.

00:36:40.194 --> 00:36:42.170
Siri: Interesting insights, human.

00:36:42.194 --> 00:36:43.955
AG: I programmed you to say that.

00:36:43.979 --> 00:36:45.843
Who's in charge now, Siri?

00:36:45.867 --> 00:36:48.357
Siri: Maybe you don't need me, after all.

00:36:48.381 --> 00:36:49.653
AG: As the world changes,

00:36:49.677 --> 00:36:52.933
betting on individual experience
can leave you stuck in the past.

00:36:53.459 --> 00:36:55.030
Investing in agility,

00:36:55.054 --> 00:36:57.758
and using hiring methods
that actually assess it,

00:36:57.782 --> 00:37:00.416
can set you up to shape the future.